          "orderIndex": 4,
          "description": "Penerjemahan sasaran bisnis ke optimasi numerik: formulasi Empirical Risk Minimization (ERM), taksonomi loss function regresi (MSE, MAE, Huber) dan klasifikasi (Cross-Entropy, Focal Loss).",
