          "orderIndex": 4,
          "description": "Identifikasi anomali ruang fitur tinggi: keterbatasan pagar IQR univariat, jarak kovarians Mahalanobis, algoritma partisi acak Isolation Forest, dan Local Outlier Factor (LOF).",
